OL,3,AJapanese polka dot artist Yayoi Kusama
OL,4,Adies aged 97
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapanese avant-garde artist Yayoi
OL,7,FKusama, who became famous for her
OL,8,Fcolourful polka dot-covered sculptures
OL,9,Fand installations, has died at the age
OL,10,Fof 97.
OL,12,FKusama, who had voluntarily lived in a
OL,13,Fpsychiatric hospital for decades, was
OL,14,Fknown for her bright red wig and her
OL,15,Fgiant, quirky creations.
OL,17,FHer exhibitions drew large crowds
OL,18,Faround the world, and her vibrant works
OL,19,Ffetched some of the highest ever prices
OL,20,Ffor a female artist.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
